  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Your gift empowers local leaders directing six grassroots change initiatives in communities in Latin America and Africa. Leaders will receive training, tools, and ongoing mentorship to develop skills needed for success: strategic planning, financial management, fundraising, program implementation, etc. Programs develop culturally appropriate solutions for impoverished communities, and include women&apos;s empowerment in South Sudan, financial literacy in Guatemala, water access in Kenya, and others.</narrative>
